---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Zomsi — Simple apps for everyday life" description="Zomsi builds focused mobile and web apps that make everyday activities simpler.">
<main>
  <section class="hero"><div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Zomsi Info Tech Private Limited</span>
    <h1 style="max-width:980px;margin-top:18px">Simple apps.<br />Useful experiences.</h1>
    <p class="lead">We build focused mobile and web products that remove friction from everyday activities. Small ideas, carefully designed and built to be genuinely useful.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/apps">Explore Our Apps</a><a class="button secondary" href="/about">About Zomsi</a></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our products</span><h2 style="margin-top:16px">Built around real-life needs.</h2></div><p>We start with a simple problem, ship a focused product, learn from real usage, and improve from there.</p></div>
    <div class="grid"><article class="card app-card"><div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Featured app</span><h2 style="margin-top:16px">Rummy Score</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="font-size:1.12rem">Indian Rummy scorekeeping for friends and family.</p>
      <p style="color:var(--muted)">Track players, rounds, drops, wrong shows, totals, history, and game results without paper score sheets.</p>
      <div class="pill-row"><span class="pill">iOS</span><span class="pill">Android</span><span class="pill">Web</span></div>
      <a class="button primary" href="/rummyscore">Learn More</a>
    </div><div class="app-art has-icon"><img src="/icons/rummyscore-icon.png" alt="Rummy Score app icon" /></div></article></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">How we build</span><h2 style="margin-top:16px">Focused by design.</h2></div></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card feature"><h3>Simple first</h3><p>We start with the smallest complete product that solves the problem clearly.</p></div>
      <div class="card feature"><h3>Cross-platform</h3><p>Our products are designed to work consistently across mobile and web where it makes sense.</p></div>
      <div class="card feature"><h3>Built to improve</h3><p>We use real feedback and product usage to decide what deserves to be built next.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</main>
</Layout>
